            recover) printf 'CONTINUE THE INTERRUPTED UBUNTU UPGRADE\nKeep the original job and pre-upgrade backups. Wait for existing package work,\nrepair pending configuration, then finish the approved upgrade.\nSLiM remains running and existing local configuration files are retained.\n' ;;
