        elif (( ! CHECK_ONLY )); then
            printf '\nBOOT CHECKS\nCheck boot mounts, free space, kernel modules and startup images.\nRebuild missing startup images and validate the generated GRUB menu.\nUnresolved boot problems stop completion and reboot advice.\nBack up and restore GRUB, XFCE, Plymouth and SLiM settings.\nRetain pre-upgrade and newest kernel boot/recovery choices.\nKeep locally modified package configurations.\n\nKeep power connected and a backup or VM snapshot available.\nClick Start to authenticate and run this plan. No automatic reboot.\n'
